= LittlerootTown_EventScript_GiveRunningShoes
msgbox	MOM: PLAYER! PLAYER! Did you introduce yourself to PROF. BIRCH?Oh! What an adorable POKéMON! You got it from PROF. BIRCH. How nice!You're your father's child, all right. You look good together with POKéMON!Here, honey! If you're going out on an adventure, wear these RUNNING SHOES.They'll put a zip in your step!
playfanfare MUS_OBTAIN_ITEM
message LittlerootTown_Text_SwitchShoesWithRunningShoes
waitfanfare
setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_RUNNING_SHOES
msgbox	MOM: PLAYER, those shoes came with instructions.“Press the B Button while wearing these RUNNING SHOES to run extra-fast!“Slip on these RUNNING SHOES and race in the great outdoors!”
msgbox	… … … … … … … … … … … … … … … …To think that you have your very own POKéMON now… Your father will be overjoyed.…But please be careful. If anything happens, you can come home.Go on, go get them, honey!
closemessage
delay 30
return
